Step 0 supports a viable Track B family: Theorem 9’s unique independent-set partition of a \(k\)-tree is constructible by the proof, while maximum-cardinality search plus greedy chordal coloring is a known linear-time mechanical solver. I found an existing draft module in the workspace and am auditing it rather than replacing it blindly.
