codex
One audit improvement is worth making before the report: the generated candidate hypergraph has exactly \(6b\) participating vertices, so counting valid \(b\)-packings is an exact-cover count. Minimum-column enumeration therefore proves there is exactly one semantic answer even at shipping size; I’m replacing the weaker sampled-only G5 density with that exact count while retaining the mandated 200,000 random trials for G4.
apply patch
